Section: Apps
Priority: optional
Description: The Ladybird browser for Xios desktop sessions
 The desktop build of Ladybird, running as a window inside a Xios desktop
 session. It adds a normal application entry and opens through whichever
 desktop you are running.
 .
 If you want a home-screen browser icon instead, install ladybird-app.
